    "\n",
    "## V. Harmonic Completion Operator <a id=\"nexus3_curvature_bezier_reflection_modelmd-v-harmonic-completion-operator\"></a>\n",
    "\n",
    "### Proposed Operator: <a id=\"nexus3_curvature_bezier_reflection_modelmd-proposed-operator\"></a>\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\mathcal{H}_C(\\psi) = \\{ \\psi : a^2(\\psi) + b^2(\\psi) = C^2 \\}\n",
    "$$\n",
