    "- Operator selects resonant configurations satisfying curvature constraint.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## VI. Implications for Collapse of Complex Systems <a id=\"nexus3_curvature_bezier_reflection_modelmd-vi-implications-for-collapse-of-complex-systems\"></a>\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6.1 Clay Millennium Problems <a id=\"nexus3_curvature_bezier_reflection_modelmd-61-clay-millennium-problems\"></a>\n",
