    "$$\n",
    "\text{Byte}_{n+1,\text{header}} = \text{Header}_n \\oplus \text{Tail}_n\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## VII. Summary Table: Pythagorean Harmonic Classes <a id=\"nexus3_curvature_bezier_reflection_modelmd-vii-summary-table-pythagorean-harmonic-classes\"></a>\n",
    "\n",
